blocks.en:
The Reviewer receives context 𝒞 \mathcal{C} together with I t I_{t} , F t F_{t} to assess whether F t F_{t} aligns with I t I_{t} .
It examines six dimensions:
(1) objects and domains (O&D) , checking that the formal types represent the intended mathematical objects and ranges;
(2) hypotheses (HYP) , checking for missing, additional, or altered assumptions;
(3) quantifiers (QUA) , checking their scope, order, and dependence on previously introduced variables;
(4) constants and bounds (C&B) , checking numerical factors, inequalities, and parameter restrictions;
(5) conclusions (CON) , checking that the formal statement covers the claimed result, including all asserted components;
(6) definition semantics (DEF) , following retained definitions to check that the underlying constructions and predicates express their intended meanings.

blocks.zh:
评论员收到上下文 C\ mathcal{C} 与 I t I_{t}, F t F_{t} 来评估 F t F_{t} 是否与 I t I_{t} 一致 。
报告审查了六个方面:
(1) 对象和域(O&D),检查形式类型是否代表预定的数学对象和范围;
(2) 假设(HYP),检查缺失、额外或改变的假设;
(3) 限定词(QUA),检查其范围、顺序和对以前引入的变量的依赖;
(4) 常数和界限(C&B),检查数值因素、不平等和参数限制;
(5) 结论(CON),核对正式陈述是否涵盖索赔结果,包括所有声称的内容;
(6) 定义语义(DEF),沿用保留的定义,以检查基本构思和上游表达其意图的含义。
